        "entry_dUzkbA": {
          "type": "entry",
          "settings": {
            "full_width_enable": false,
            "title": "Where can I buy extra blades and other spare parts?",
            "text": "<p>Replacement blades and other spares such as boundary wire, boundary wire repair kits and our patented labour-saving device, the LawnMaster Peg Driver, can be purchased from the accessories section above.</p><p>We recommend that blades are replaced  whenever the lawn cut looks uneven, or blades appear to be damaged or worn during routine inspection. <br/><br/>Always replace in sets to preserve normal function of the machine.</p>",
            "button_1_style": "white",
            "button_1_text": "",
            "button_1_url": "",
            "button_2_style": "white",
            "button_2_text": "",
            "button_2_url": "",
