            "full_width_enable": false,
            "title": "I can’t remember my pin code, what do I do?",
            "text": "<p>Please call the help line on 0191 654 0036 and we can talk you through how to re-set your PIN. For security reasons, we may ask you about details relating to your order to verify ownership of the mower.</p>",
