        "entry_fMhh3n": {
          "type": "entry",
          "settings": {
            "full_width_enable": false,
            "title": "Will I still need a traditional lawnmower?",
            "text": "<p>You may still require a traditional mower if your garden has tricky areas that the L12 cannot navigate, such as steep slopes, extremely bumpy areas, or areas exposed to the general public such as front lawns. Although the L12 has an edge cutting function, it will still leave a small border (around 20cm) of lawn un-cut where the boundary wire is laid 30cm away from the edge of the lawn. We recommend using a grass trimmer to tidy the edges.<br/></p>",
            "button_1_style": "white",
            "button_1_text": "",
            "button_1_url": "",
            "button_2_style": "white",
