        "entry_4zaaTi": {
          "type": "entry",
          "settings": {
            "full_width_enable": false,
            "title": "What is the maximum cutting area?",
            "text": "<p>The L12 can cut a maximum area of 400m2. In order to achieve the best finish, we recommend cutting the lawn to 30mm with a traditional mower before starting the L12 for the first time. This will result in a neat finish from the start. </p><p>Alternatively, the L12 can be started at a relatively high height of cut (40mm) and allowed to cut the grass down gradually. It may take several days to achieve a uniform finish this way, depending on the size of garden.</p>",
            "button_1_style": "white",
            "button_1_text": "",
            "button_1_url": "",
            "button_2_style": "white",
            "button_2_text": "",
