        "entry_NxnmaP": {
          "type": "entry",
          "settings": {
            "full_width_enable": false,
            "title": "How often do I need to clean it?",
            "text": "<p>We recommend inspecting your L12 every 8 weeks to check for damage and wear to the blades. During this time, it can be useful to give the mower a clean with a cloth or brush to remove any built up grass and mud, particularly in the wheel treads. </p><p>The L12 is IPX5 rated, meaning that it can be cleaned using a standard garden hose if necessary. </p><p><strong>Do not use high powered jet wash equipment for this task</strong>.</p>",
            "button_1_style": "white",
            "button_1_text": "",
            "button_1_url": "",
            "button_2_style": "white",
            "button_2_text": "",
            "button_2_url": "",
