        "entry_pWdLG7": {
          "type": "entry",
          "settings": {
            "full_width_enable": false,
            "title": "How long does it need to be charged for?",
            "text": "<p>The L12 automatically senses when the battery is low and will return to the base station along the boundary wire. During a mowing period of 8 hours, the mower will return to the base to be charged multiple times. The amount of times will depend on the length of grass being mown.</p>",
            "button_1_style": "white",
            "button_1_text": "",
